      "statement": "API-11 sits downstream of the loan servicing systems and API-09 Credit Decisioning bookings, and upstream of MDL-CR-007 CECL (EAD, remaining life), MDL-ALM-014 NII Sensitivity (repricing profile), API-10 Credit Risk Scoring and API-01 Accounts.",
