      "id": "claim_21ed0ff85490464d98ed6212d1887db3",
      "statement": "Platform-wide conventions apply to API-11: OAuth 2.0 with 15-minute JWTs and mTLS for server clients, major version in path with minor versions additive, Idempotency-Key required on resource-creating POSTs (retained 24 hours), and a standard error envelope with 429 Retry-After.",
